[l_english.INVENTORY_ITEM_6MY_C15_BLOOD_CRYSTAL]
Blood Crystal

[l_english.INVENTORY_ITEM_6MY_C15_BLOOD_CRYSTAL_DESC]
In the Frozen North, beneath the seal of the Blood Crystal, is a paradise in the shadows... In that underground paradise, a species different from the crystal ponies awaits the arrival of the son of shadow foretold in prophecy, awaiting their redemption.
Despite their attempts to hide and conceal themselves for a thousand years, all it takes is a small magic lamp to illuminate the vision of the visitor, allowing them to catch a glimpse of the consequences of “redemption” eloquently spoken by these gentle and kind creatures.

[l_simp_chinese.INVENTORY_ITEM_6MY_C15_BLOOD_CRYSTAL]
影之血水晶

[l_simp_chinese.INVENTORY_ITEM_6MY_C15_BLOOD_CRYSTAL_DESC]
在冰封北境，影之血水晶的封印之下，是一片暗影中的乐园... 在那地下乐园中，一支与水晶小马不同的种族，等待着预言中的暗影之子降临，等待着他们的救赎。
尽管她们千年来在试图躲藏和掩饰，但只需要一盏小小的魔法灯，就足以照亮来者的视野，让她们瞥见一角，这些温柔而和善的生物口中“救赎”的后果。

